      "value": "Duplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/give-us-a-way-to-share-private-avatars\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-avatar-sharing\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatarsworld-private-uploading\n\n...and many other similar topics.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/avatar-visibility-only-friends-instead-of-just-public-and-private",
