  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Basically a system where only those the Creator/Owner of the avatar select can clone and wear an avatar or a list of avatars. This would be easier for both commissioned avatars but keeping avatars made for just friends or members of a project with Vrchat as a medium. The current way is fine but tedious, and its annoying when having avatars public just for a friend and then someone random player steals the thing. With a system like this, it would be easier to keep an avatar in only a small circle without having to upload to someone's account besides the creator.",
